{"hw":"τῇ","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">τῇ</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">τῇ</span>, as <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = ταύτῃ, <b class=\"lex-tr\">here, there</b>, <abbr>v.</abbr> <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> </span> VIII. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span>.</div></div>"}